# 05. AEGIS Operational State Machine

Every operational event moves through controlled states.

```text
OBSERVED
   ↓
DETECTED
   ↓
DISCOVERED
   ↓
ASSESSED
   ↓
INVESTIGATING
   ↓
CHARACTERIZED
   ↓
TRANSMISSION UNDERSTOOD
   ↓
CONTAINMENT PLANNED
   ↓
CONTAINMENT ACTIVE
   ↓
RESPONSE ACTIVE
   ↓
RECOVERY
   ↓
LEARNING
   ↓
PREPAREDNESS UPDATED
   ↓
CLOSED
```

Not every event will reach every state.

For example:

```text
OBSERVED
   ↓
DETECTED
   ↓
ASSESSED
   ↓
RESOLVED
```

may be valid for a low-significance anomaly.

The architecture must therefore distinguish between:

**operational progression**

and

**screen navigation**.

A user opening another screen does not automatically advance the operational state.

