# 35. AEGIS Journey Invariants

The following rules must remain true across the entire application.

## Invariant 01

**A signal is not automatically a threat.**

## Invariant 02

**A recommendation is not an action.**

## Invariant 03

**A proposed intervention is not an executed intervention.**

## Invariant 04

**An inference is not a confirmed fact.**

## Invariant 05

**Navigation does not change operational state unless an explicit action does so.**

## Invariant 06

**Every operational state change must have a traceable cause.**

## Invariant 07

**New evidence can change previous understanding.**

## Invariant 08

**Recovery does not mean monitoring stops.**

## Invariant 09

**Completed events remain useful for preparedness.**

## Invariant 10

**All screens represent the same underlying operational reality.**

