# 38. Operational Journey Success Definition

AEGIS succeeds when the user can move from:

**"Something changed."**

to:

**"We understand what changed."**

to:

**"We understand the risk."**

to:

**"We understand what may be causing it."**

to:

**"We know where intervention can occur."**

to:

**"We have coordinated the response."**

to:

**"We can see whether the response is working."**

to:

**"We understand recovery."**

to:

**"We have strengthened future preparedness."**

That is the complete AEGIS operational journey.

