# 40. Architectural Principle to Carry Into Engineering

The implementation must preserve this fundamental relationship:

```text
ONE EVENT
   ↓
ONE GLOBAL STATE
   ↓
MANY OPERATIONAL PERSPECTIVES
```

Not:

